WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.468
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.936
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.772
And now if you don't mind, we
are going to get to the news.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:09.074
President Biden said yesterday
that he will travel next week

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:10.209
to the southern border

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:11.977
for the first time
since taking office.

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:15.481
When asked if it was dangerous,
the Secret Service said,

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.485
"A little, but we don't think
he'll actually try to escape."

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:22.388
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.423
The House of Representatives
adjourned last night

00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:26.893
after a sixth round of voting
for House Speaker

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.961
and reconvened today at noon.

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:31.097
Because nothing says
"we're working hard

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:34.367
to solve this problem"
like starting at noon.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.669
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.104
Former President Trump
reportedly called

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.539
House Republican leader
Kevin McCarthy on Monday night

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:42.041
ahead of the Speaker vote

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:45.945
and urged him to accept all
of the Freedom Caucus's demands.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:48.047
But unfortunately
McCarthy told him

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:50.950
hair gel in the water fountains
wasn't feasible.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.319
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.222
Goldman Sachs this week
ended its free coffee perk

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.756
for employees, which is weird,

00:00:57.756 --> 00:01:01.027
because there are still
piles of sugar on the desks?

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:03.296
[ Audience ohs, laughs ]

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:10.836
A federal appeals court ruled --
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:12.938
A federal appeals court
ruled last week

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:14.607
that a teacher
in Washington State

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.342
who wore a MAGA hat to school

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.943
was protected
by the 1st Amendment.

00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:20.113
"Cool,"
said one of his students.

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:23.450
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.820
According to a new report,
nearly half of American workers

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.755
are planning to look for a
new job in the next six months.

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:32.592
And some will still be looking
for the same one.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:35.395
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:37.630
The "New York Post"
recently launched a contest

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.466
for high school students to win
a chance to publish an article,

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:41.767
and it was a reminder...

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:45.104
you cannot trust Hannah R.
with anything.

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.307
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:53.779
A baby gear start-up company
this week unveiled

00:01:53.779 --> 00:01:56.915
a $3,300 self-driving stroller.

00:01:56.915 --> 00:02:00.252
Previously, all the self-driving
strollers on the market

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:01.988
only worked on hills.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:05.325
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:10.730
Mechan--
[ Laughs ]

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.932
Mechanics at
a Florida car dealership

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.835
recently found a rabbit
trapped in the vehicle's motor

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.336
while doing an oil change.

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:20.840
Said the mechanic, "So, that's
gonna be at least another $750,

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.175
and I can't even
get another rabbit here

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:24.410
until late next week."

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:29.715
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:32.218
Today was
National Screenwriters Day.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.587
They spent it --
interior -- Starbucks --

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:35.722
pretending to work.

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:40.159
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:43.229
And finally, today was also
National Bird Day.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.964
Or, as they call it
in New Jersey,

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:45.998
a turn signal.

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:47.867
You guys...
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:50.570
...that was the monologue,
and we are off.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:51.771
We are off and running.

